WEBVTT

00:26.256 --> 00:33.245
The world was burning The lies were loud. We were

00:33.285 --> 00:35.585
the joking tabloid crowd.

00:39.046 --> 00:45.327
We had no shelter. We had no home. Just the open

00:45.387 --> 00:51.369
road and a telephone. Were you?

00:54.438 --> 01:00.182
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:00.242 --> 01:03.764
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

01:03.804 --> 01:09.028
storm. You are the iron hand. You are the shield.

01:09.048 --> 01:14.211
The only army that would not yield.

01:15.272 --> 01:20.956
This is our fortress.

01:24.077 --> 01:31.019
This isn't LA. This isn't a dream. This is a

01:31.079 --> 01:37.661
warehouse. This is a scream. We're building our

01:37.701 --> 01:43.863
truth. We're building our sound. Right here on

01:44.303 --> 01:49.745
our hallowed ground. God is yellow.

01:52.035 --> 01:57.779
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:57.859 --> 02:01.381
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

02:01.401 --> 02:08.546
storm. You are the iron head. You are the shield.

02:08.746 --> 02:17.132
The only army that would not yield. This is our

02:17.252 --> 02:18.593
fortress.

02:52.896 --> 02:59.278
Fortress Our home

02:59.338 --> 03:04.060
We are the Fortress

